WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.730
Can you find a limit when you can't plug the number in?

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:12.790
(x² − 1)/(x − 1) at x = 1 gives 0/0.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.920
But for every other x it equals x + 1.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.013
So as x gets close to 1, it heads to 2.
